title = Citadis 304
description = Citadis is a family of low-floor trams and light rail vehicles built by Alstom. As of 2025, over 8,000 Citadis trams have been ordered, with operations in over 140 cities on all six inhabited continents. This Citadis X04 series tram, built by Alstom between 2010 and 2011, offers top speed of 80 km/h and a capacity for 64 seated passengers, it boasts a length of 33.5 meters, making it a versatile addition to metropolitan rail networks.
